      "text": "We are pleased to invite you and your colleagues to participate in the DesignTech 2026 – International Conference on Design and Technology, which will take place on May 6-7th, 2026 at the Technion – Israel Institute of Technology, Haifa.\n\nThis interdisciplinary conference provides a platform for researchers and practitioners to present their latest work in the evolving field of design and technology. We welcome abstract submissions (300–500 words) that reflect innovative research and emerging design theory.\n\nSubmission Deadline: March 31 2026\nNotification of Acceptance: April 16, 2026\nSubmit to: designtech2026@technion.ac.il",
      "date": "2026-01-18T10:06:46+0000",
      "type": "IMAGE"
    },
